{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/b1460988d64a656e728818eda4734e7f.poster.avif?t=1762458780\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/b1460988d64a656e728818eda4734e7f.webm?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/b1460988d64a656e728818eda4734e7f.mp4?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>WORDS ARE EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a mix of word game + adventures on hot air balloon + some city building mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gameplay heart</strong> is simple - to make any action (get fuel, build building, fly etc..) use the last three letters of the previous word to create a new one and entering words will keep your journey going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/02ff1c20158a70c62717eaa65c7c23d1.poster.avif?t=1762458780\" width=1170 height=731 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/02ff1c20158a70c62717eaa65c7c23d1.webm?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAVE  ADVENTURES WHILE LEARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The vision</strong>  is to build an\u00a0<strong>open world</strong> and have <strong>journeys</strong> in that world while <strong>learning / remembering</strong> new words in native or foreign languages - basically <strong>to have fun while the brain will study</strong>:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/f494170616d430a67ab7d218c9b40891.poster.avif?t=1762458780\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/f494170616d430a67ab7d218c9b40891.webm?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/f494170616d430a67ab7d218c9b40891.mp4?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD &amp; FLY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fly over landscapes in hot air balloon and research surroundings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build your own settlement - or settlements to support your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight with different, tricky and ever changeable weather, especially wind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >research technologies to discover new buildings, improve hot air balloon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >customize character you are playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/731983e7910eac03763269b620246fac.avif?t=1762458780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras_big/731983e7910eac03763269b620246fac.webp?t=1762458780 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > limited time - play \u201cjust fly\u201d mode without any complications of full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > little more time - play \u201cbuild &amp; fly\u201d to have technologies tree, create buildings and more complex control of hot air balloon. Progress always saved, so it is safe to abandon game for while and return to it to continue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/2c839fce59a404bf3593d423ebf2b1a9.poster.avif?t=1762458780\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/2c839fce59a404bf3593d423ebf2b1a9.webm?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/2c839fce59a404bf3593d423ebf2b1a9.mp4?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY TOGETHER ON SAME DEVICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently game supports playing on the same device on turn based manner - each player plays after another (about 10 people in the game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One word = one action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea is not compete with each other, but help each other - because you are all traveling together:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME EVOLUTION</strong><br>I\u2019m developing every mechanics suited specifically for the vision of the game - to make the playing time fun and educational. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them passes test of time and works well. Some of them are not - and will be modified and removed. Every mechanics released has its own error &amp; trial process, and some of the features are based on feedback of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore my promise is quite simple - to evolve the game over time to fit the vision even if it will be played only by small community:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will be glad any feedback and opinions:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far your curiosity and thinking will take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843460?t=1762458780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843460?t=1762458780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/afb9408182f7f6e9c3bdede4a0c7adc2434444ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762458780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/afb9408182f7f6e9c3bdede4a0c7adc2434444ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762458780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post