mp; fly\u201d to have technologies tree, create buildings and more complex control of hot air balloon. Progress always saved, so it is safe to abandon game for while and return to it to continue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/2c839fce59a404bf3593d423ebf2b1a9.poster.avif?t=1762458780\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/2c839fce59a404bf3593d423ebf2b1a9.webm?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/extras/2c839fce59a404bf3593d423ebf2b1a9.mp4?t=1762458780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY TOGETHER ON SAME DEVICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently game supports playing on the same device on turn based manner - each player plays after another (about 10 people in the game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One word = one action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea is not compete with each other, but help each other - because you are all traveling together:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME EVOLUTION</strong><br>I\u2019m developing every mechanics suited specifically for the vision of the game - to make the playing time fun and educational. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them passes test of time and works well. Some of them are not - and will be modified and removed. Every mechanics released has its own error &amp; trial process, and some of the features are based on feedback of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore my promise is quite simple - to evolve the game over time to fit the vision even if it will be played only by small community:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will be glad any feedback and opinions:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far your curiosity and thinking will take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["xsoulspace"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843460/5f5fae68f6646203f750fc48e30320dbb56cf5d6/header.jpg?t=1762458780","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz+ (not verified yet)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 capable GPU with 1GB VRAM - GeForce GTX 750 Ti, Radeon R7 360 or Intel UHD Graphics 730<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+ (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 12 capable GPU with 4 GB VRAM - GeForce GTX 1050 Ti, Radeon RX 570, Intel Arc<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2020 Apple Silicon M1 or Intel Core (not tested)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> METAL capable GPU required. Macs with AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 GPUs currently not supported.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2020 Apple Silicon M1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>