s/steam/apps/3843460/0f4bb1305731ef2c82c5f2e183364e7e6caed70e/ss_0f4bb1305731ef2c82c5f2e183364e7e6caed70e.600x338.jpg?t=1762458780"}],"short_description":"The word-by-word-powered world (literally, every your word = energy) to take adventures on hot air balloon and build settlements (city builder) to play alone or with friends on the same device. How far your curiosity and thinking will take you?","steam_appid":3843460,"support_info":{"email":"support@xsoulspace.dev","url":"https://discord.gg/y54DpJwmAn"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Italian, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}